WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.038
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:05.688
Building Privileged Access.

3
00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:09.238
This is Chapter 6: PIM
for Azure resources.

4
00:00:09.238 --> 00:00:13.240
Standing Owner and Contributor are
what an attacker hopes to find,

5
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.314
so this chapter makes those roles
eligible, time-bound and approved,

6
00:00:17.314 --> 00:00:20.588
and holds the settings as
reviewed code at every scope.

7
00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:25.496
We'll start from Learn's walkthroughs
and Microsoft's own request examples,

8
00:00:25.496 --> 00:00:28.346
see what they leave to
you, then walk the plan,

9
00:00:28.346 --> 00:00:31.275
the dry run, the apply,
two labs and the dangers.

10
00:00:31.275 --> 00:00:36.480
One note before we begin: the code is
illustrative, tested against fixtures.
